      {
        "index": 1,
        "gloss": "to twist (threads of different colours) together (into a string)",
        "register": "standard",
        "nuance": null,
        "scenarios": [],
        "sensory_tags": {
          "colors": [],
          "temperature": null,
          "sounds": [],
          "emotions": []
        },
        "collocations": [],
        "examples": {
          "standard": [
            {
              "text": "職人は、数種類の異なる色の糸をない交ぜて、美しい模様の織物を作り上げた。",
              "citation": {
                "source": "Illusions AI",
                "author": "Gemini",
                "note": "gemini-2.5-flash"
              }
            },
            {
              "text": "古い布を細く裂いてない交ぜると、新しい敷物になる。",
              "citation": {
                "source": "Illusions AI",
                "author": "Gemini",
                "note": "gemini-2.5-flash"
              }
            },
            {
              "text": "彼女はいつも、異なる素材をない交ぜて独創的なアクセサリーを作る。",
              "citation": {
                "source": "Illusions AI",
                "author": "Gemini",
                "note": "gemini-2.5-flash"
              }
            }
          ],
          "literary": []
        }
      },
      {
        "index": 2,
        "gloss": "to mix",
        "register": "standard",
        "nuance": null,
        "scenarios": [],
        "sensory_tags": {
          "colors": [],
          "temperature": null,
          "sounds": [],
          "emotions": []
        },
        "collocations": [],
        "examples": {
          "standard": [
            {
              "text": "いくつかのスパイスをない交ぜて、オリジナルのカレー粉を作った。",
              "citation": {
                "source": "Illusions AI",
                "author": "Gemini",
                "note": "gemini-2.5-flash"
              }
            },
            {
              "text": "彼の絵画は、伝統的な技法と現代的な要素をない交ぜている。",
              "citation": {
                "source": "Illusions AI",
                "author": "Gemini",
                "note": "gemini-2.5-flash"
              }
            },
            {
              "text": "新しいカクテルは、甘味と酸味をない交ぜた絶妙なバランスだ。",
              "citation": {
                "source": "Illusions AI",
                "author": "Gemini",
